<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">

<title>Identitas Jumlah dan Selisih</title>
<metadata>
  <md:content-id>m49395</md:content-id>
  <md:title>Identitas Jumlah dan Selisih</md:title>
  <md:abstract><para id="para-00001">Pada bagian ini, Anda akan:</para>
<list id="list-00001">
<item>menggunakan rumus jumlah dan selisih untuk kosinus.</item>
<item>menggunakan rumus jumlah dan selisih untuk sinus.</item>
<item>menggunakan rumus jumlah dan selisih untuk tangen. </item>
<item>menggunakan rumus jumlah dan selisih untuk kofungsi.</item>
<item>menggunakan rumus jumlah dan selisih untuk memverifikasi identitas.</item>
</list></md:abstract>
  <md:uuid>114b550a-8cbc-46bc-bd8e-507d2a652c47</md:uuid>
</metadata>

<content>
  <figure id="Figure_07_02_001" class="small"><media id="fs-id3063401" alt="Foto Gunung McKinley (sebelumnya Denali).">
      <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_02_001.jpg" />
    </media>

  <caption>Denali, yang secara resmi dinamai Gunung McKinley oleh pemerintah federal, menjulang 20.237 kaki (6.168 m) di atas permukaan laut di Taman Nasional Denali, Alaska. Denali adalah puncak tertinggi di Amerika Utara. (Kredit: Daniel A. Leifheit, Flickr)</caption></figure><para id="fs-id2463462">Bagaimana ketinggian gunung dapat diukur? Bagaimana dengan jarak Bumi ke Matahari? Seperti banyak masalah yang tampaknya mustahil, kita mengandalkan rumus matematika untuk memperoleh jawaban. Identitas trigonometri, yang lazim digunakan dalam pembuktian matematika, telah diterapkan di dunia nyata selama berabad-abad, termasuk untuk menghitung jarak yang sangat jauh.</para>
  <para id="fs-id1237528">Identitas trigonometri yang akan kita pelajari dalam bagian ini dapat ditelusuri hingga seorang astronom Persia yang hidup sekitar tahun 950 M. Namun, bangsa Yunani kuno telah menemukan rumus yang sama jauh sebelumnya dan menyatakannya dalam bentuk tali busur. Identitas-identitas ini merupakan persamaan atau postulat khusus yang benar untuk setiap nilai masukan dan memiliki tak terhitung banyak penerapan.</para>
  <para id="fs-id2285295">Di bagian ini, kita akan mempelajari teknik yang akan memungkinkan kita memecahkan masalah seperti yang diungkapkan di atas. Rumus berikut akan menyederhanakan banyak ekspresi trigonometri dan persamaan. Perlu diingat bahwa, di seluruh bagian ini, istilah <emphasis effect="italics">rumus</emphasis> digunakan secara sinonim dengan kata <emphasis effect="italics">identitas</emphasis>.</para>



  <section id="fs-id1902399"><title>Menggunakan Rumus Jumlah dan Selisih untuk Kosinus</title>
<para id="fs-id2264960">Menemukan nilai eksak dari sinus, kosinus, atau tangen sudut sering lebih mudah jika kita dapat menulis ulang sudut yang diberikan dalam hal dua sudut yang memiliki nilai trigonometri yang diketahui. Kita bisa menggunakan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00001">sudut khusus</term>, yang dapat kita lihat di lingkaran satuan yang ditunjukkan di <link target-id="Figure_07_02_008" />.</para>


    <figure id="Figure_07_02_008"><media id="fs-id1617288" alt="Diagram lingkaran satuan dengan titik-titik berlabel pada kelilingnya. Titik P membentuk sudut a dari arah positif sumbu x dan berkoordinat (cosa, sina). Titik Q membentuk sudut B dari arah positif sumbu x dan berkoordinat (cosb, sinb). Sudut POQ besarnya a - B derajat. Titik A membentuk sudut (a-B) dari sumbu x dan berkoordinat (cos(a-B), sin(a-B)). Titik B tepat berada di (1,0). Sudut AOB juga besarnya a - B derajat. Jari-jari PO, AO, QO, dan BO masing-masing sepanjang 1 satuan dan menjadi sisi-sisi segitiga POQ dan AOB. Segitiga POQ merupakan rotasi segitiga AOB, sehingga jarak P ke Q sama dengan jarak A ke B. ">
        <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_01_004-93aa.jpg" />
      </media>
    <caption>Lingkaran Satuan</caption></figure><para id="fs-id2618307">Kita akan mulai dengan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00002">rumus jumlah dan selisih untuk kosinus</term>, sehingga kita dapat mencari kosinus suatu sudut dengan menguraikan sudut tersebut menjadi jumlah atau selisih dua sudut khusus. Lihat <link target-id="Table_07_02_01" />.</para>

    <table id="Table_07_02_01" summary="Dua baris, dua kolom. Tabel ini memiliki pasangan nilai baris ini: (Rumus jumlah untuk kosinus, cos(a+B) = cos(a)cos(B) - sin(a)sin(B)) dan (Rumus selisih untuk kosinus, cos(a-B) = cos(a)cos(B) + sin(a)sin(B)).">
<tgroup cols="2"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
        <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
        <tbody>
          <row>
            <entry align="center"><emphasis>Rumus jumlah untuk kosinus</emphasis></entry>
            <entry align="center"> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </entry>
          </row>


          <row>
            <entry align="center"><emphasis>Rumus selisih untuk kosinus</emphasis></entry>
            <entry align="center"> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </entry>
          </row>
        </tbody>


</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id3007968">Pertama, kita akan membuktikan rumus selisih untuk kosinus. Mari kita pertimbangkan dua titik pada lingkaran satuan. Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_02_002" />. Titik <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>P</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> membentuk sudut <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>α</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dari arah positif sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dengan koordinat <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan titik <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>Q</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> membentuk sudut <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>β</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dari arah positif sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dengan koordinat <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> Perhatikan ukuran sudut <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mi>O</m:mi><m:mi>Q</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> adalah <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para><para id="fs-id1565012">Beri label pada dua titik lagi: <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>A</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> pada sudut <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dari arah positif sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dengan koordinat <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>;</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan titik <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>B</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dengan koordinat <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> Segitiga <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mi>O</m:mi><m:mi>Q</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> merupakan hasil rotasi dari segitiga <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>O</m:mi><m:mi>B</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan dengan demikian jarak dari <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>P</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> ke <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>Q</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> adalah sama dengan jarak dari <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>A</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> ke <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para>

    <figure id="Figure_07_02_002" class="small"><media id="fs-id1130636" alt="Diagram lingkaran satuan dengan titik-titik berlabel pada kelilingnya. Titik P membentuk sudut a dari arah positif sumbu x dan berkoordinat (cosa, sina). Titik Q membentuk sudut B dari arah positif sumbu x dan berkoordinat (cosb, sinb). Sudut POQ besarnya a - B derajat. Titik A membentuk sudut (a-B) dari sumbu x dan berkoordinat (cos(a-B), sin(a-B)). Titik B tepat berada di (1,0). Sudut AOB juga besarnya a - B derajat. Jari-jari PO, AO, QO, dan BO masing-masing sepanjang 1 satuan dan menjadi sisi-sisi segitiga POQ dan AOB. Segitiga POQ merupakan rotasi segitiga AOB, sehingga jarak P ke Q sama dengan jarak A ke B.">
        <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_02_002.jpg" />
      </media>
    </figure>
<para id="fs-id2152546">Kita bisa menemukan jarak dari <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>P</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> ke <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>Q</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> menggunakan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00003">rumus jarak</term>.<newline /></para>

<equation id="fs-id1096956" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msub>
       <m:mi>d</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mi>Q</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msub>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id2239334">Kemudian kita menerapkan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00004">Identitas Pythagoras</term> dan menyederhanakannya.</para><equation id="fs-id1343608" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
     <m:mtr><m:mtd>
      <m:mtable columnalign="left">
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mtd></m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1342538">Demikian pula, menggunakan rumus jarak kita dapat menemukan jarak dari <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>A</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> ke <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para>
    <equation id="fs-id1094579" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msub>
       <m:mi>d</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>B</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msub>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>      </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1783115">Dengan menerapkan Identitas Pythagoras dan menyederhanakannya, diperoleh:</para><equation id="fs-id1347258" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
     <m:mtr><m:mtd>
      <m:mtable columnalign="left">
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mtd></m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msqrt>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="fs-id2196869">Karena kedua jarak sama, kita menyamakannya lalu menyederhanakan.</para>
    <equation id="fs-id1729317" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
     <m:mtr><m:mtd>
      <m:mtable columnalign="left">
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:msqrt>
          <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mtd></m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>  </m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mtext>        </m:mtext>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1411215">Akhirnya kita mengurangi <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dari kedua sisi dan membagi kedua sisi dengan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mn>−2.</m:mn>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para>

<equation id="fs-id1491684" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mtext>  </m:mtext>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </equation>

    <para id="fs-id711534">Jadi, kita telah memperoleh rumus selisih untuk kosinus. Cara serupa dapat digunakan untuk menurunkan kosinus jumlah dua sudut.</para>

    <note id="fs-id1334205">

<title>Rumus Jumlah dan Selisih untuk Kosinus</title>
      <para id="fs-id1261808">Rumus ini dapat digunakan untuk menghitung kosinus dari jumlah dan selisih sudut.</para>
      <equation id="Eq_07_02_01" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation>
      <equation id="Eq_07_02_02" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation>
    </note><note id="fs-id861912" class="how-to-notitle">
      <label>Cara</label>
      <para id="fs-id1728576"><emphasis>Jika diberikan dua sudut, tentukan kosinus selisih kedua sudut tersebut.
      </emphasis></para>
      <list id="fs-id1374215" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic">
        <item>Tuliskan rumus selisih untuk kosinus.</item>
      <item>Substitusikan nilai kedua sudut yang diberikan ke dalam rumus.</item>
      <item>Sederhanakan.</item>
      </list>
    </note>

    <example id="Example_07_02_01">
      <exercise id="fs-id1733838">
        <problem id="fs-id2056629">
          <title>Menentukan Nilai Eksak dengan Rumus Kosinus Selisih Dua Sudut</title>
          <para id="fs-id1953099">Menggunakan rumus untuk kosinus selisih dua sudut, temukan nilai eksak dari <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1772170">
        <para id="fs-id1128213">Gunakan rumus kosinus selisih dua sudut. Kita peroleh</para>
<equation id="fs-id1369035" class="unnumbered"><label />
 <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable columnalign="left">
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
             <m:mi>π</m:mi>
             <m:mn>6</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mi>π</m:mi>
             <m:mn>6</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mi>π</m:mi>
             <m:mn>6</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mtext>                   </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:msqrt>
               <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msqrt>

             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:msqrt>
               <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              </m:msqrt>

             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mrow>
              <m:msqrt>
               <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msqrt>

             </m:mrow>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mn>1</m:mn>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mtext>                   </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:msqrt>
             <m:mn>6</m:mn>
            </m:msqrt>

           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:msqrt>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:msqrt>

           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mtext>                   </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
             <m:mn>6</m:mn>
            </m:msqrt>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
             <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:msqrt>

           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>
       <m:mtr columnalign="left">
        <m:mtd columnalign="left">
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
      </exercise>
    </example>
    <note id="fs-id1369787" class="precalculus try">
      <label>Coba</label>
      <exercise id="ti_07_02_01">
        <problem id="fs-id2118816">
        <para id="fs-id1557062">Temukan nilai eksak dari <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1542577">
        <para id="fs-id1721765"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></solution>
      </exercise>
    </note>

    <example id="Example_07_02_02">
      <exercise id="fs-id2956024">
        <problem id="fs-id1367064">
          <title>Menentukan Nilai Eksak dengan Rumus Kosinus Jumlah Dua Sudut</title>
          <para id="fs-id1161788">Temukan nilai eksak dari <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>75</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                  </m:msup>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1349727">
        <para id="fs-id1711386">Karena <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>75</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>45</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>30</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
            </m:msup>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> kita bisa mengevaluasi <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>75</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                </m:msup>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> sebagai <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>45</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>30</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                </m:msup>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> Jadi,</para>

<equation id="fs-id1834810" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>45</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>30</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>45</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>30</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>45</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>30</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
        </exercise>
      </example>

    <note id="fs-id1343512" class="precalculus try">
      <label>Coba</label>
      <exercise id="ti_07_02_02">
        <problem id="fs-id1335750"><para id="fs-id1231482">Temukan nilai eksak dari <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>105</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                </m:msup>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1167651"><para id="fs-id1094264"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>
                <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></solution>
      </exercise>
    </note>
  </section>

<section id="fs-id1388326">
    <title>Menggunakan Rumus Jumlah dan Selisih untuk Sinus</title>
    <para id="fs-id1198942"><term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00005">Rumus jumlah dan selisih untuk sinus</term> dapat diturunkan dengan cara yang sama seperti rumus kosinus, dan bentuknya serupa dengan rumus-rumus tersebut.</para>

    <note id="fs-id1345043"><title>Rumus Jumlah dan Selisih untuk Sinus</title>

      <para id="fs-id2335392">Rumus ini dapat digunakan untuk menghitung sinus dari jumlah dan selisih sudut.</para>

      <equation id="Eq_07_02_03" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation><equation id="Eq_07_02_04" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation></note><note id="fs-id1274546" class="how-to-notitle">
      <label>Cara</label>
      <para id="fs-id1891863"><emphasis>Jika diberikan dua sudut, tentukan sinus selisih kedua sudut tersebut.
      </emphasis></para>
      <list id="fs-id1352419" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic">
        <item>Tuliskan rumus selisih untuk sinus.</item>
      <item>Substitusikan kedua sudut yang diberikan ke dalam rumus.</item>
      <item>Sederhanakan.</item>
      </list>
    </note>

    <example id="Example_07_02_03">
      <exercise id="fs-id1368235">
        <problem id="fs-id1242560">
          <title>Menggunakan Identitas Jumlah dan Selisih untuk Menghitung Selisih Sudut</title>
          <para id="fs-id1304945">Gunakan identitas jumlah dan selisih untuk menghitung selisih sudut dan tunjukkan bahwa bagian <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> sama dengan bagian <emphasis effect="italics">b.</emphasis></para>
         <list id="fs-id1978491" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
           <item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
             <m:mrow>
               <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                 <m:mrow>
                   <m:msup>
                     <m:mrow>
                       <m:mn>45</m:mn>
                     </m:mrow>
                     <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                   </m:msup>
                   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                     <m:mrow>
                       <m:mn>30</m:mn>
                     </m:mrow>
                     <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                   </m:msup>

                 </m:mrow>
                 <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
             </m:mrow>
           </m:math>
           </item>
           <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
             <m:mrow>
               <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                 <m:mrow>
                   <m:msup>
                     <m:mrow>
                       <m:mn>135</m:mn>
                     </m:mrow>
                     <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                   </m:msup>
                   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                     <m:mrow>
                       <m:mn>120</m:mn>
                     </m:mrow>
                     <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                   </m:msup>

                 </m:mrow>
                 <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
             </m:mrow>
           </m:math>
           </item></list>
        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1290383">


        <list id="fs-id2291665" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
          <item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Mari kita mulai dengan menulis rumus dan mensubstitusikan sudut-sudut yang diberikan.<equation id="fs-id1712849" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
         <m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>45</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>30</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>45</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>30</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>45</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>30</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1565917">Selanjutnya, kita perlu menemukan nilai ekspresi trigonometri.</para>
            <equation id="fs-id1213031" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:msup>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>45</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                    </m:msup>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:msqrt>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msqrt>

                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:msup>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>30</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                    </m:msup>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:msqrt>
                        <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      </m:msqrt>

                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:msup>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>45</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                    </m:msup>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:msqrt>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msqrt>

                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:msup>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>30</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                    </m:msup>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </equation>
        <para id="fs-id1143054">Sekarang kita bisa mengganti nilai-nilai ini ke dalam persamaan dan menyederhanakan.</para>
            <equation id="fs-id2020743" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>45</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>30</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
        <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Sekali lagi, kita menulis rumus dan menggantikan sudut yang diberikan.
          <equation id="fs-id1135014" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
         <m:mtext>          </m:mtext><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>135</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>120</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>135</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>120</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>135</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>120</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="fs-id1177711">Selanjutnya, kita menemukan nilai ekspresi trigonometri.</para>
          <equation id="fs-id2067561" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>135</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                  </m:msup>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:msqrt>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msqrt>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>120</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                  </m:msup>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>135</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                  </m:msup>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:msqrt>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msqrt>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msup>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>120</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                  </m:msup>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:msqrt>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    </m:msqrt>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </equation><para id="fs-id2011119">Sekarang kita bisa mengganti nilai-nilai ini ke dalam persamaan dan menyederhanakan.</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1922441" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>135</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>120</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>
        <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>135</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>120</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>
        <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                           </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
        </list>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
    </example>

    <example id="Example_07_02_04">
      <exercise id="fs-id1494014">
        <problem id="fs-id1494016">
          <title>Menentukan Nilai Eksak Ekspresi yang Melibatkan Fungsi Trigonometri Invers</title>
          <para id="fs-id1252839">Temukan nilai eksak dari <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>−1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>−1</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn>
     <m:mn>5</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>

</para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1669693">
          <para id="fs-id1669695">Pola yang ditampilkan dalam masalah ini adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> Misalkan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>−1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
   </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>−1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
   <m:mn>5</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo> </m:mrow>
</m:math> Lalu kita bisa menulis</para>
<equation id="fs-id1868250" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1562263">Kita akan menggunakan identitas Pythagoras untuk menemukan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para><equation id="fs-id2044989" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mtable columnalign="left">
  <m:mtr>
   <m:mtd>
    <m:mtable columnalign="left">
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>1</m:mn>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>9</m:mn>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>25</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>16</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>25</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>
     <m:mtr columnalign="left">
      <m:mtd columnalign="left">
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mtd>
     </m:mtr>

    </m:mtable>
   </m:mtd>
  </m:mtr>
 </m:mtable>

</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1155089">Dengan menggunakan rumus jumlah untuk sinus,</para>
<equation id="fs-id1231462" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>−1</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>−1</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:msup>
        <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>
        <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
      </exercise>
    </example>

  </section>

  <section id="fs-id2072911">
    <title>Menggunakan Rumus jumlah dan selisih untuk tangen</title>
    <para id="fs-id2780782">Menentukan nilai eksak tangen jumlah atau selisih dua sudut sedikit lebih rumit, tetapi sekali lagi, kuncinya adalah mengenali pola.</para>
    <para id="fs-id2780786">Penurunan rumus tangen jumlah dua sudut dilakukan dengan membagi rumus jumlah sinus dengan rumus jumlah kosinus lalu menyederhanakannya. Ingat, <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mn>0.</m:mn>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para><para id="fs-id1712352">Mari kita turunkan rumus jumlah untuk tangen.</para>

<equation id="fs-id1185845" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                 </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                 </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Bagi pembilang dan penyebut dengan cos</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mtext>cos</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                 </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:menclose>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:menclose>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:menclose>
          <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:menclose>
          <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:menclose>
          <m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:menclose>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:menclose>
          <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
           </m:mrow>
          </m:menclose>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                 </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                 </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1775901">Kita bisa mendapatkan rumus selisih untuk tangen dengan cara yang sama.</para>
<note id="fs-id2916561">

<title>Rumus Jumlah dan Selisih untuk Tangen</title>
      <para id="fs-id2320803"><term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00006">Rumus jumlah dan selisih untuk tangen</term> adalah:</para>
      <equation id="Eq_07_02_05" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation><equation id="Eq_07_02_06" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </equation></note><note id="fs-id1567999" class="how-to-notitle">
      <label>Cara</label>
      <para id="fs-id1233471"><emphasis>Jika diberikan dua sudut, tentukan tangen jumlah kedua sudut tersebut.
      </emphasis></para>
      <list id="fs-id1407099" number-style="arabic" list-type="enumerated">
        <item>Tulis rumus jumlah untuk tangen.</item>
      <item>Substitusikan kedua sudut yang diberikan ke dalam rumus.</item>
      <item>Sederhanakan.</item>
      </list>
    </note>
    <example id="Example_07_02_05">
      <exercise id="fs-id1619329">
        <problem id="fs-id2289172">
          <title>Menentukan Nilai Eksak Ekspresi yang Melibatkan Tangen</title>
          <para id="fs-id2289178">Temukan nilai eksak dari <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1378916">


        <para id="fs-id1378918">Mula-mula tulis rumus jumlah untuk tangen, lalu substitusikan kedua sudut yang diberikan ke dalam rumus.</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1514603" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>6</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mi>π</m:mi>
             <m:mn>6</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
             <m:mi>π</m:mi>
             <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

           </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1378455">Selanjutnya, tentukan nilai masing-masing tangen dalam rumus:</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1378458" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:msqrt>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    </m:msqrt>

                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </equation>
        <para id="fs-id2016988">Jadi, diperoleh</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1576577" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mn>1</m:mn>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:msqrt>
             <m:mn>3</m:mn>
            </m:msqrt>

           </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                  </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                  </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>

         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:msqrt>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:msqrt>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                  </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>
        <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msqrt>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:msqrt>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
      </exercise>
    </example>

    <note id="fs-id1541743" class="precalculus try">
      <label>Coba</label>
      <exercise id="ti_07_02_03">
        <problem id="fs-id1527860"><para id="fs-id1892528">Temukan nilai eksak dari <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2040849"><para id="fs-id2040850"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></solution>
      </exercise>
    </note>

    <example id="Example_07_02_06">
      <exercise id="fs-id2927791"><problem id="fs-id2927793">
          <title>Menentukan Beberapa Jumlah dan Selisih Sudut</title>
          <para id="fs-id1333289">Diberi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
   <m:mn>5</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>5</m:mn>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>13</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> tentukan</para><list id="fs-id2201332" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
            <item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </item>
            <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </item>
            <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </item>
            <item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </item>
          </list>

        </problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1483247">


        <para id="fs-id1483249">Rumus jumlah dan selisih dapat digunakan untuk menentukan jumlah atau selisih sudut jika rasio sinus, kosinus, atau tangen setiap sudut diketahui. Untuk itu, kita membuat segitiga acuan guna menentukan setiap komponen dalam rumus jumlah dan selisih.</para>
        <list id="fs-id1440867" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Untuk menentukan <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> kita mulai dengan <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> dan <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>.</m:mo>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> Sisi di hadapan sudut <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>α</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> panjangnya 3, hipotenusanya panjang 5, dan <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>α</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> berada di kuadran pertama. Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_02_003" />. Dengan Teorema Pythagoras, kita dapat menentukan panjang sisi <equation id="fs-id2191216" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>:</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mi>a</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>​</m:mtext><m:mtext>        </m:mtext><m:msup>
       <m:mi>a</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>          </m:mtext><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>

</m:math>
</equation><figure id="Figure_07_02_003" class="small"><media id="fs-id1669679" alt="Diagram segitiga siku-siku pada bidang x,y. Titik-titik sudutnya berada di titik asal, (4,0), dan (4,3). Sudut di titik asal berukuran alfa derajat. Sudut yang dibentuk sumbu x dan sisi dari (4,3) ke (4,0) adalah sudut siku-siku. Sisi di hadapan sudut siku-siku panjangnya 5.">
            <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_02_003-e4a8.jpg" />
          </media>
        </figure><para id="fs-id1342733">Karena <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>13</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> dan <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>,</m:mo>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> sisi yang berdekatan dengan sudut <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> adalah <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>−5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> hipotenusanya panjang 13, dan <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> berada di kuadran ketiga. Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_02_004" />. Sekali lagi, dengan menggunakan Teorema Pythagoras, diperoleh</para>

<equation id="fs-id1944725" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mi>a</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>13</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
       <m:mi>a</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>169</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
       <m:mi>a</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>144</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1928233">Karena <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> berada di kuadran ketiga, <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>–12.</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </para><figure id="Figure_07_02_004" class="small"><media id="fs-id2153543" alt="Diagram segitiga siku-siku pada bidang x,y. Titik-titik sudutnya berada di titik asal, (-5,0), dan (-5,-12). Sudut di titik asal berukuran Beta derajat. Sudut yang dibentuk sumbu x dan sisi dari (-5,-12) ke (-5,0) adalah sudut siku-siku. Sisi di hadapan sudut siku-siku panjangnya 13.">
        <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_02_004-e86a.jpg" />
      </media>
        </figure><para id="fs-id1155212">Langkah selanjutnya adalah menemukan kosinus dari <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>α</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> dan sinus dari <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> Kosinus dari <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>α</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> adalah sisi samping dibagi hipotenusa. Nilainya dapat ditentukan dari segitiga pada <link target-id="Figure_07_02_004" />: <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>.</m:mo>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> Kita juga bisa menemukan sinus dari <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> dari segitiga di <link target-id="Figure_07_02_004" />, sebagai perbandingan sisi depan terhadap hipotenusa: <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>13</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>.</m:mo>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> Sekarang kita siap untuk mengevaluasi <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </para>

            <equation id="fs-id2256453" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>13</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>12</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>13</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>15</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>65</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>48</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>65</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>63</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>65</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
          <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Kita bisa menemukan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em" />
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dengan cara yang sama. Kita menggantikan nilai sesuai dengan rumus.
            <equation id="fs-id1487615" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                 </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>13</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>12</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>13</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                 </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>20</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>65</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>36</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>65</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                 </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>16</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>65</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
          <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> Untuk <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> jika <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                <m:mn>5</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                <m:mn>5</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>,</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> Lalu
            <equation id="fs-id1512831" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mfrac>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mfrac>
                      <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                      <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>

                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                  <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </equation>
            <para id="fs-id1837927">Jika <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>13</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> dan <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>13</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>,</m:mo>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
              Lalu</para>
            <equation id="fs-id2917183" class="unnumbered"><label />
          <m:math display="block">
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mfrac>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>13</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:mfrac>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mfrac>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>13</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:mfrac>

                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </equation>
        <para id="fs-id2900205">Lalu,</para>
            <equation id="fs-id2900208" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>12</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>12</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>5</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mtext>  </m:mtext><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>63</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>20</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>16</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>20</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>​</m:mtext><m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>63</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>16</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
          <item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> Untuk menentukan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> kita sudah memiliki nilai-nilai yang diperlukan. Kita dapat mensubstitusikannya dan menghitung hasilnya.<equation id="fs-id2575375" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>12</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>12</m:mn>
           </m:mrow>
           <m:mn>5</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>

         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>33</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>20</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>56</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>20</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>33</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>56</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item></list></solution>
        <commentary id="fs-id2714729">
          <title>Analisis </title>
          <para id="fs-id2714734">Kesalahan umum ketika menangani masalah seperti ini adalah bahwa kita mungkin tergoda untuk berpikir bahwa <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>β</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> merupakan sudut-sudut dalam segitiga yang sama, padahal tentu saja bukan. Perhatikan juga bahwa</para>
          <equation id="fs-id2202966" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </equation>
        </commentary>
      </exercise></example>

  </section>

  <section id="fs-id2050772"><title>Menggunakan Rumus Jumlah dan Selisih untuk Kofungsi</title><para id="fs-id1527759">Setelah dapat menentukan fungsi sinus, kosinus, dan tangen untuk jumlah dan selisih sudut, kita dapat melakukan hal yang sama untuk kofungsinya. Anda mungkin ingat dari <link document="m49384">Trigonometri Segitiga Siku-Siku</link> bahwa jika jumlah dua sudut positif adalah <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> kedua sudut itu saling berkomplemen; jumlah dua sudut lancip dalam segitiga siku-siku adalah <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> sehingga kedua sudut itu juga saling berkomplemen. Pada <link target-id="Figure_07_02_007" />, perhatikan bahwa jika salah satu sudut lancip diberi label <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> sudut lancip lainnya harus diberi label <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mi>π</m:mi>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para><para id="fs-id2045066">Perhatikan juga bahwa <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mi>π</m:mi>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>:</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> adalah sisi depan dibagi hipotenusa. Jadi, jika dua sudut saling berkomplemen, kita dapat mengatakan bahwa sinus <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> sama dengan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00007">kofungsi</term> dari komplemen dari <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> Demikian juga, tangen dan kotangen adalah kofungsi, dan sekan dan kosekan adalah kofungsi.</para><figure id="Figure_07_02_007" class="small"><media id="fs-id2872065" alt="Gambar segitiga siku-siku. Dua sudut lainnya diberi label theta dan pi/2 - theta.">
        <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_02_007.jpg" />
      </media>
    </figure><para id="fs-id2338660">Dari hubungan ini terbentuk <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00008">identitas kofungsi</term>.</para>

    <note id="fs-id2247036"><title>Identitas Kofungsi</title>

      <para id="fs-id2247045">Identitas kofungsi diringkas dalam <link target-id="Table_07_02_02" />.</para>

      <table id="Table_07_02_02" summary="Tabel tiga baris dan dua kolom yang memuat pasangan identitas kofungsi berikut: sin(theta) = cos(pi/2 - theta) dan cos(theta) = sin(pi/2 - theta); tan(theta) = cot(pi/2 - theta) dan cot(theta) = tan(pi/2 - theta); serta sec(theta) = csc(pi/2 - theta) dan csc(theta) = sec(pi/2 - theta).">
<tgroup cols="2"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" align="center" />
          <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" align="center" />
          <tbody>
            <row>
              <entry align="center"> <m:math>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:mfrac>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:math>
              </entry>
              <entry align="center"> <m:math>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:mfrac>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:math>
              </entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry align="center"> <m:math>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:mfrac>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:math>
              </entry>
              <entry align="center"> <m:math>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:mfrac>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:math>
              </entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry align="center"> <m:math>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:mfrac>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:math>
              </entry>
              <entry align="center"> <m:math>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:mfrac>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:math>
              </entry>
            </row>
          </tbody>

</tgroup>
</table></note><para id="fs-id2814240">Perhatikan bahwa rumus dalam tabel juga dapat dibuktikan secara aljabar menggunakan rumus jumlah dan selisih. Misalnya, dengan menggunakan</para>
    <equation id="fs-id2814245" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </equation>
    <para id="fs-id2021193">Kita bisa menulis</para>
    <equation id="fs-id2427498" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                 </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                 </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><example id="Example_07_02_07">
      <exercise id="fs-id2223313">
        <problem id="fs-id2223315">
          <title>Menentukan Kofungsi yang Bernilai Sama dengan Ekspresi yang Diberikan</title>
          <para id="fs-id2231859">Tuliskan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>9</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dalam hal kofungsi.</para>
</problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1556115">
          <para id="fs-id1556117">Kofungsi dari <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> Jadi,</para>
<equation id="fs-id2274481" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>9</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>9</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>          </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>18</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>18</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>          </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>18</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
      </exercise>
    </example>

    <note id="fs-id2109946" class="precalculus try">
      <label>Coba</label>
      <exercise id="ti_07_02_04">
        <problem id="fs-id1923901"><para id="fs-id1923902">Tuliskan <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mfrac>
              <m:mi>π</m:mi>
              <m:mn>7</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> dalam hal kofungsi.</para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1386355"><para id="fs-id1386356"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>14</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></solution>
      </exercise>
    </note>

  </section><section id="fs-id1926444">
    <title>Menggunakan Rumus Jumlah dan Selisih untuk Memverifikasi Identitas</title>
    <para id="fs-id2637951">Memverifikasi identitas berarti menunjukkan bahwa persamaan berlaku untuk semua nilai variabel. Sebaiknya kita menguasai identitas-identitas tersebut atau menyediakan daftarnya ketika mengerjakan soal. Meninjau aturan umum dari <link document="m49393">Menyederhanakan dan Memverifikasi Identitas Trigonometri</link> dapat membantu menyederhanakan proses verifikasi identitas.</para><note id="fs-id2637962" class="how-to-notitle">
      <label>Cara</label>
      <para id="fs-id1863876"><emphasis>Jika diberikan suatu identitas, verifikasilah dengan rumus jumlah dan selisih.</emphasis></para><list id="fs-id1863880" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic">
        <item>Mulailah dari ekspresi di salah satu sisi tanda sama dengan yang tampak paling rumit. Tulis ulang ekspresi itu hingga sama dengan sisi lainnya. Kadang-kadang kedua sisi perlu diubah, tetapi mengerjakan satu sisi saja biasanya paling efisien.</item>
      <item>Carilah kesempatan untuk menggunakan rumus jumlah dan selisih.</item>
      <item>Tulis ulang jumlah atau selisih beberapa hasil bagi sebagai satu hasil bagi.</item>
      <item>Jika proses menjadi rumit, tulis ulang ekspresi dalam hal sinus dan kosinus.</item>
      </list>
    </note>

    <example id="Example_07_02_08">
      <exercise id="fs-id1183047">
        <problem id="fs-id1183049">
          <title>Memverifikasi Identitas yang Melibatkan Sinus</title>
          <para id="fs-id1899828">Verifikasilah identitas <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>

          </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1469822">


        <para id="fs-id1469824">Ruas kiri persamaan memuat sinus jumlah dan selisih sudut.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1469827" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1154806">Kita bisa menulis ulang masing-masing menggunakan rumus jumlah dan selisih.</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1154809" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1947264">Kita melihat bahwa identitas telah diverifikasi.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
    </example>

    <example id="Example_07_02_09">
      <exercise id="fs-id1858950">
        <problem id="fs-id1858952">
          <title>Memverifikasi Identitas yang Melibatkan Tangen</title>
          <para id="fs-id1858957">Verifikasi identitas berikut.</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1858960" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1636590">

        <para id="fs-id1636592">Kita dapat mulai dengan menulis ulang pembilang di sisi kiri persamaan.</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1636595" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:menclose>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:menclose>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:menclose>
        <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:menclose notation="updiagonalstrike">
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:menclose>
        <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mtable>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Tulis ulang menggunakan penyebut persekutuan</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Coret faktor yang sama</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>Tulis ulang dalam bentuk tangen</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1260145">Identitas tersebut telah diverifikasi. Dalam banyak kasus, identitas tangen dapat diverifikasi dengan menulis tangen dalam bentuk sinus dan kosinus.</para>

        </solution>
      </exercise>
    </example>

    <note id="fs-id2822685" class="precalculus try">
      <label>Coba</label>
      <exercise id="ti_07_02_05"><problem id="fs-id1248124"><para id="fs-id1248125">Verifikasikan identitas: <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1152803">
          <equation id="fs-id1152805" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
      </exercise></note>

    <example id="Example_07_02_10"><exercise id="fs-id2092391">
        <problem id="fs-id2092393">
          <title>Menggunakan Rumus Jumlah dan Selisih untuk Menyelesaikan Masalah Penerapan</title>
          <para id="fs-id2092399">Misalkan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msub>
                <m:mi>L</m:mi>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn>
              </m:msub>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msub>
                <m:mi>L</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msub>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> menyatakan dua garis tak vertikal yang berpotongan, dan misalkan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> menunjukkan sudut akut antara <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msub>
                <m:mi>L</m:mi>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn>
              </m:msub>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msub>
                <m:mi>L</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msub>
              <m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> Lihatlah <link target-id="Figure_07_02_005" />. Tunjukkan bahwa</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1728421" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msub>
                    <m:mi>m</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msub>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msub>
                    <m:mi>m</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                  </m:msub>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msub>
                    <m:mi>m</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                  </m:msub>
                  <m:msub>
                    <m:mi>m</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msub>

                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </equation><para id="fs-id1924955">di mana <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msub>
                <m:mi>m</m:mi>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn>
              </m:msub>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msub>
                <m:mi>m</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msub>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> merupakan gradien dari <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msub>
                <m:mi>L</m:mi>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn>
              </m:msub>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msub>
                <m:mi>L</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msub>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> secara berturut-turut. (<emphasis>Petunjuk:</emphasis> Gunakan fakta bahwa <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:msub>
                <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn>
              </m:msub>
              <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msub>
                <m:mi>m</m:mi>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn>
              </m:msub>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:msub>
                <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msub>
              <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msub>
                <m:mi>m</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msub>
              <m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> )</para><figure id="Figure_07_02_005" class="small"><media id="fs-id1568187" alt="Diagram dua garis tak vertikal L1 dan L2 yang berpotongan satu sama lain dan juga memotong sumbu x. Sudut lancip di antara L1 dan L2 adalah theta. Sudut lancip di antara L2 dan sumbu x adalah theta 1, sedangkan sudut lancip di antara sumbu x dan L1 adalah theta 2. ">
              <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_02_005.jpg" />
            </media>
          </figure></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2260059">


        <para id="fs-id2260061">Dengan rumus selisih untuk tangen, masalah ini tidak sesulit yang tampak.</para>
          <equation id="fs-id2260064" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub>
       <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
      </m:msub>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msub>
       <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:msub>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:msub>
         <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
        </m:msub>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:msub>
         <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msub>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:msub>
         <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
        </m:msub>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:msub>
         <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msub>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>       </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:msub>
         <m:mi>m</m:mi>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
        </m:msub>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msub>
         <m:mi>m</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msub>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msub>
         <m:mi>m</m:mi>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
        </m:msub>
        <m:msub>
         <m:mi>m</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msub>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></solution>
        </exercise>
        </example><example id="Example_07_02_11"><exercise id="fs-id1367169">
        <problem id="fs-id1784865">
          <title>Mengkaji Masalah Kawat Penyangga</title>
          <para id="fs-id1784870">Untuk sebuah dinding panjat, kawat penyangga <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>R</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dipasang pada ketinggian 47 kaki di sebuah tiang vertikal. Penyangga tambahan diberikan oleh kawat penyangga lain <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>S</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dipasang 40 kaki di atas tanah pada tiang yang sama. Jika kedua kawat ditambatkan ke tanah sejauh 50 kaki dari tiang, tentukan sudut <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> di antara kedua kawat. Lihat <link target-id="Figure_07_02_006" />.</para>

          <figure id="Figure_07_02_006" class="small"><media id="fs-id1386435" alt="Dua segitiga siku-siku memiliki alas yang sama sepanjang 50 kaki. Segitiga pertama memiliki tinggi 40 kaki dan hipotenusa S; segitiga kedua memiliki tinggi 47 kaki dan hipotenusa R. Sisi tinggi kedua segitiga saling bertumpuk. Terdapat sudut B derajat di antara R dan alas, serta sudut a derajat di antara kedua hipotenusa di dalam sudut B.  ">
              <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_02_006.jpg" />
            </media>
          </figure></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2136275">

          <para id="fs-id2136278">Pertama, mari kita rangkum informasi dari diagram. Karena hanya sisi-sisi yang mengapit sudut siku-siku yang diketahui, kita dapat menggunakan fungsi tangen. Perhatikan bahwa <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>47</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>50</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>,</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>40</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>50</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                <m:mn>5</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> Kita kemudian bisa menggunakan rumus selisih untuk tangen.</para>
<equation id="fs-id2177692" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>α</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </equation>
        <para id="fs-id2007573">Dengan mensubstitusikan nilai-nilai yang diketahui ke dalam rumus, diperoleh</para>
          <equation id="fs-id2007576" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>                    </m:mtext><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>4</m:mn>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>47</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>50</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>47</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>50</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>47</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>50</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>47</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>50</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow />
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>
<para id="fs-id1933373">Gunakan sifat distributif, lalu sederhanakan fungsi-fungsinya.</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1933377" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>47</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>50</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>47</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>50</m:mn>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3.76</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.7</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3.76</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.7</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mn>8.76</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.7</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>0.07991</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:msup>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:msup>
      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.07991</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>.079741</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation>

<para id="fs-id1691817">Sekarang kita bisa menghitung sudut dalam derajat.</para>
          <equation id="fs-id1691820" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>0.079741</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>180</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  </m:mfrac>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>4.57</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
                </m:msup>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </equation>
        </solution>
        <commentary id="fs-id2230083">
          <title>Analisis </title>
          <para id="fs-id2230088" />

        <para id="fs-id2230090">Kadang-kadang, ketika suatu penerapan melibatkan segitiga siku-siku, kita mungkin mengira bahwa penyelesaiannya cukup dengan menerapkan Teorema Pythagoras. Anggapan itu mungkin sebagian benar, tetapi jawabannya bergantung pada apa yang ditanyakan dan informasi yang diberikan.</para>
        </commentary>
      </exercise>
    </example><note id="fs-id1243690" class="precalculus media media-notitle"><label>Media</label>
      <para id="eip-id3766817">Akses sumber daya daring berikut untuk memperoleh penjelasan dan latihan tambahan tentang identitas jumlah dan selisih. </para>
      <list id="fs-id1243697">
        <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/sumdifcos">Identitas Jumlah dan Selisih untuk Kosinus</link></item>
        <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/sumdifsin">Identitas Jumlah dan Selisih untuk Sinus</link></item>
        <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/sumdiftan">Identitas Jumlah dan Selisih untuk Tangen</link></item>
      </list>
   </note></section>
  <section id="fs-id2332636" class="key-equations"><title>Persamaan Utama</title><table id="fs-id2332643" summary="Tabel tujuh baris yang merangkum rumus jumlah dan selisih untuk kosinus, sinus, dan tangen, serta identitas kofungsi." class="unnumbered unstyled"><label />
      <title />
      <tgroup cols="2">
        <colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
        <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
        <tbody>
          <row>
            <entry align="center">Rumus Jumlah untuk Kosinus</entry>
            <entry align="center"> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </entry>
          </row>


          <row>
            <entry align="center">Rumus Selisih untuk Kosinus</entry>
            <entry align="center"> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry align="center">Rumus Jumlah untuk Sinus</entry>
            <entry align="center"> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry align="center">Rumus Selisih untuk Sinus</entry>
            <entry align="center"> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry align="center">Rumus Jumlah untuk Tangen</entry>
            <entry align="center"> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry align="center">Rumus Selisih untuk Tangen</entry>
            <entry align="center"> <m:math>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>
            </entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry align="center">Identitas kofungsi</entry>
            <entry align="center"> <m:math>
              <m:mtable columnalign="left">
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd>
                    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd>
                    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd>
                    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd>
                    <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd>
                    <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd>
                    <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
              </m:mtable>

            </m:math>
            </entry>
          </row>
        </tbody>
      </tgroup>
    </table>

  </section><section id="fs-id2224028" class="key-concepts">
    <title>Konsep Utama</title><list id="fs-id2224035"><item>Rumus jumlah untuk kosinus menyatakan bahwa kosinus jumlah dua sudut sama dengan hasil kali kosinus kedua sudut dikurangi hasil kali sinus kedua sudut. Rumus selisih untuk kosinus menyatakan bahwa kosinus selisih dua sudut sama dengan hasil kali kosinus kedua sudut ditambah hasil kali sinus kedua sudut.</item>
      <item>Rumus jumlah dan selisih dapat digunakan untuk menemukan nilai-nilai eksak dari sinus, kosinus, atau tangen sudut. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_02_01" /> dan <link target-id="Example_07_02_02" />.</item>
      <item>Rumus jumlah untuk sinus menyatakan bahwa sinus jumlah dua sudut sama dengan hasil kali sinus sudut pertama dan kosinus sudut kedua ditambah hasil kali kosinus sudut pertama dan sinus sudut kedua. Rumus selisih untuk sinus menyatakan bahwa sinus selisih dua sudut sama dengan hasil kali sinus sudut pertama dan kosinus sudut kedua dikurangi hasil kali kosinus sudut pertama dan sinus sudut kedua. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_02_03" />.</item>
      <item>Rumus jumlah dan selisih untuk sinus dan kosinus juga dapat digunakan pada fungsi trigonometri invers. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_02_04" />.</item>
      <item>Rumus jumlah untuk tangen menyatakan bahwa tangen jumlah dua sudut sama dengan jumlah tangen kedua sudut dibagi 1 dikurangi hasil kali tangen kedua sudut. Rumus selisih untuk tangen menyatakan bahwa tangen selisih dua sudut sama dengan selisih tangen kedua sudut dibagi 1 ditambah hasil kali tangen kedua sudut. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_02_05" />.</item>
      <item>Teorema Pythagoras bersama rumus jumlah dan selisih dapat digunakan untuk menentukan beberapa jumlah dan selisih sudut. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_02_06" />.</item>
      <item>Identitas kofungsi berlaku untuk sudut komplementer dan pasangan fungsi resiprokal. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_02_07" />.</item>
      <item>Rumus jumlah dan selisih berguna untuk memverifikasi identitas. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_02_08" /> dan <link target-id="Example_07_02_09" />.</item>
      <item>Masalah penerapan sering lebih mudah diselesaikan dengan rumus jumlah dan selisih. Lihat <link target-id="Example_07_02_10" /> dan <link target-id="Example_07_02_11" />.</item>
    </list></section>

  <section id="fs-id2633717" class="section-exercises">

    <title>Latihan Bagian</title><section id="fs-id2633720">
      <title>Verbal</title>
      <exercise id="fs-id2633726"><problem id="fs-id2633727"><para id="fs-id2633728">Jelaskan dasar identitas kofungsi dan kapan identitas tersebut berlaku.</para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id1879713">
        <para id="fs-id1879715">Identitas kofungsi berlaku untuk sudut komplementer. Jika salah satu dari dua sudut lancip pada segitiga siku-siku berukuran <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> ukuran sudut kedua <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mi>π</m:mi>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> Lalu <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" />
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> Hal yang sama berlaku untuk identitas kofungsi lainnya. Kuncinya adalah bahwa sudut-sudut itu saling melengkapi.</para></solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1784023"><problem id="fs-id1784024"><para id="fs-id1784025">Apakah hanya ada satu cara untuk mengevaluasi <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>?</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> Jelaskan cara menyusun penyelesaian dengan dua cara berbeda, lalu hitunglah untuk memastikan bahwa keduanya memberikan jawaban yang sama.</para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1943345"><problem id="fs-id1943346"><para id="fs-id1943347">Jelaskan kepada seseorang yang lupa sifat genap-ganjil fungsi sinusoidal bagaimana rumus jumlah dan selisih dapat menentukan sifat ini untuk <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> (Petunjuk: <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> )</para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2169008">
        <para id="fs-id2169010"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> sehingga <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> merupakan fungsi ganjil. <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> sehingga <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> merupakan fungsi genap. </para></solution></exercise>

    </section>
    <section id="fs-id2030146">
      <title>Aljabar</title>
      <para id="fs-id2030152">Untuk latihan berikut, carilah nilai eksaknya.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id1535795"><problem id="fs-id1535796"><para id="fs-id1535797"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2686776"><problem id="fs-id2686777"><para id="fs-id2686778"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2168727">
        <para id="fs-id1546201"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
</solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1343104"><problem id="fs-id1343105"><para id="fs-id1343106"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1662806"><problem id="fs-id1662807"><para id="fs-id1662808"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1617565">
          <para id="fs-id1617567"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msqrt>
                    <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                  </m:msqrt>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msqrt>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2327970"><problem id="fs-id2327971"><para id="fs-id2327972"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2641720"><problem id="fs-id2641721"><para id="fs-id2641722"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2340648">
          <para id="fs-id2340651"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              </m:msqrt>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>

      <para id="fs-id1872453">Untuk latihan berikut, tulis ulang dalam bentuk <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para><exercise id="fs-id1944688"><problem id="fs-id1944689"><para id="fs-id1944690"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>6</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1924818"><problem id="fs-id1924819"><para id="fs-id1924820"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2907493">
          <para id="fs-id2907495"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msqrt>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msqrt>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msqrt>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msqrt>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2289260"><problem id="fs-id2289261"><para id="fs-id2289262"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>6</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1923485"><problem id="fs-id1923486"><para id="fs-id1923487"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1784094">
          <para id="fs-id1784096"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msqrt>
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                  </m:msqrt>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <para id="fs-id1186242">Untuk latihan berikut, sederhanakan ekspresi yang diberikan.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id1587348"><problem id="fs-id1587349"><para id="fs-id1587350"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>t</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1931167"><problem id="fs-id1931168"><para id="fs-id1931169"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1973312">
          <para id="fs-id1973314"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1405117"><problem id="fs-id1405118"><para id="fs-id1405119"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1223240" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1223241"><para id="fs-id2168811"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2780585">
          <para id="fs-id2780587"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2306521" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2306522"><para id="fs-id2306523"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1359485"><problem id="fs-id2164270"><para id="fs-id2164271"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mfrac>
                      <m:mn>7</m:mn>
                      <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mfrac>
                      <m:mn>7</m:mn>
                      <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2148683">
          <para id="fs-id2148686"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>10</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <para id="fs-id1912452">Untuk latihan berikut, tentukan informasi yang diminta.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id1912455" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1912456"><para id="fs-id1912457">Mengingat bahwa <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
   </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dengan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>a</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>b</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> keduanya dalam interval <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mi>π</m:mi>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi>
          </m:mrow> <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> tentukan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1256165" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1256166"><para id="fs-id1256167">Mengingat bahwa <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mn>1</m:mn>
            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dengan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>a</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>b</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> keduanya dalam interval <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mi>π</m:mi>
              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow> <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> tentukan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2011927">
        <para id="fs-id2011929"> <m:math><m:mrow>         <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mfrac>
                      <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                      <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mfrac>
                        <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                        <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      </m:mfrac>

                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                          <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>

                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mrow>
                              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                              </m:msqrt>

                            </m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                          </m:mfrac>

                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                            </m:msqrt>

                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>15</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
</m:mrow></m:math> <newline />
 <m:math><m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mfrac>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mfrac>
                        <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                        <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      </m:mfrac>

                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                          <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>

                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mrow>
                              <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                              </m:msqrt>

                            </m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                          </m:mfrac>

                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                              <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                            </m:msqrt>

                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>15</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para></solution></exercise>

      <para id="fs-id2478807">Untuk latihan berikut, carilah nilai eksak dari setiap ekspresi.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id2478810" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2478811"><para id="fs-id2478812"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2126676" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2126677"><para id="fs-id2126678"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:msqrt>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msqrt>

                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:msup>
              <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:msqrt>
                        <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      </m:msqrt>

                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2229929">
          <para id="fs-id2229931"> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:msqrt>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:msqrt>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
                    <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                  </m:msqrt>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>

            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2337567" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2336035"><para id="fs-id2336036"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:msup>
              <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                  </m:mfrac>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>

    </section>
    <section id="fs-id1408229">
      <title>Grafis</title>
      <para id="fs-id2259918">Untuk latihan berikut, sederhanakan ekspresinya, lalu gambarkan kedua ekspresi sebagai fungsi untuk memverifikasi bahwa grafiknya identik.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id2259922"><problem id="fs-id2259924"><para id="fs-id2259925"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id1411053">
        <para id="fs-id1411055"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>

        <media id="fs-id1615462" alt="Grafik dari y=sin(x) dari -2pi ke 2pi." display="block">
          <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_02_201-c02d.jpg" />
        </media>


</solution></exercise><exercise id="fs-id1555893"><problem id="fs-id1555894"><para id="fs-id1555895"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2960991"><problem id="fs-id2960992"><para id="fs-id1430117"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2113188">
        <para id="fs-id2113190"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>

        <media id="fs-id2233832" alt="Grafik y=cot(pi/6 - x) dari -2pi hingga pi. Dibandingkan dengan grafik biasa y=cot(x), grafik ini dicerminkan terhadap sumbu x dan digeser sebesar pi/6." display="block">
          <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_02_203-d60a.jpg" />
        </media>


</solution></exercise><exercise id="fs-id1502696"><problem id="fs-id1502697"><para id="fs-id1502698"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1724458"><problem id="fs-id1724459"><para id="fs-id1724460"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2307482">
        <para id="fs-id2307484"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>

        <media id="fs-id1877975" alt="Grafik y=cot(pi/4 + x). Dibandingkan dengan grafik biasa y=cot(x), grafik ini digeser sebesar pi/4. " display="block">
          <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_02_205.jpg" />
        </media>


</solution></exercise><exercise id="fs-id1252765"><problem id="fs-id1252766"><para id="fs-id1252768"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>6</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>        </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1681120"><problem id="fs-id2255437"><para id="fs-id2255438"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id1752326">
        <para id="fs-id1752329"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>

          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>

        <media id="fs-id2199923" alt="Grafik y = sin(x) / rad2 + cos(x) / rad2; bentuknya menyerupai kurva sinus yang digeser sebesar pi/4." display="block">
          <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_07_02_207.jpg" />
        </media>


</solution></exercise><exercise id="fs-id2199934"><problem id="fs-id2199935"><para id="fs-id1672664"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>

      <para id="fs-id2710551">Untuk latihan berikut, gunakan grafik untuk menentukan apakah kedua fungsi sama atau berbeda. Jika sama, tunjukkan alasannya. Jika berbeda, ganti fungsi kedua dengan fungsi yang identik dengan fungsi pertama. (Petunjuk: pikirkan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
        )</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id1493462" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2308858"><para id="fs-id2308859"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2253378">
<para id="fs-id2253381">Mereka sama. </para>
</solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1086612" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1086613"><para id="fs-id1086614"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2102136" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2102137"><para id="fs-id2102138"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2190226">
          <para id="fs-id2190228">Mereka berbeda, cobalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1367081" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1367082"><para id="fs-id1367083"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1573766" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1573767"><para id="fs-id1573768"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1544806">
          <para id="fs-id1544808">Mereka sama. </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1544812" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1544813"><para id="fs-id1544814"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1687448" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1687449"><para id="fs-id1687450"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>θ</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

</m:math>
</para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1186010">
          <para id="fs-id1186012">Mereka berbeda, cobalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msup>
                    <m:mi>θ</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
              <m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2888541" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2888542"><para id="fs-id2888544"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:msup>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:msup>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1664714" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1664715"><para id="fs-id1664716"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id1547116">
        <para id="fs-id1547118">Mereka berbeda, cobalah <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>.</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
</solution></exercise>

    </section>
    <section id="fs-id1429668">
      <title>Teknologi</title>
      <para id="fs-id1429674">Untuk latihan berikut, carilah nilai eksaknya secara aljabar, lalu konfirmasikan jawaban dengan kalkulator hingga empat tempat desimal.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id1429678"><problem id="fs-id1429679"><para id="fs-id1429680"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>75</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
              </m:msup>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1604725"><problem id="fs-id1604726"><para id="fs-id1604727"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>195</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
              </m:msup>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id1874100">
        <para id="fs-id1874102"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>
                <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext> atau </m:mtext><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.2588</m:mn>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
</solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2160300"><problem id="fs-id2160301"><para id="fs-id2160302"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>165</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
              </m:msup>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2613308"><problem id="fs-id2613309"><para id="fs-id2613310"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>345</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
              </m:msup>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2214309">
        <para id="fs-id1676814"> <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mfrac>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msqrt>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msqrt>

              </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>,</m:mo>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> atau 0.9659</para></solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2291639"><problem id="fs-id2291640"><para id="fs-id2291641"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mn>15</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>∘</m:mo>
              </m:msup>

            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>

    </section>
    <section id="fs-id2244374">
      <title>Pengayaan</title>


      <para id="fs-id2244379">Untuk latihan berikut, buktikan identitas yang diberikan.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id2244382" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2244383"><para id="fs-id2244384"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2884046">
        <para id="fs-id2884049"> <m:math>
          <m:mtable>
            <m:mtr>
              <m:mtd>
                <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                      <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>

                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo>
              </m:mtd>
            </m:mtr>
            <m:mtr>
              <m:mtd>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>

                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>

                      </m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo>
              </m:mtd>
            </m:mtr>
            <m:mtr>
              <m:mtd>
                <m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>

              </m:mtd>
            </m:mtr>
          </m:mtable>

        </m:math>
        </para>
</solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1743113" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1743114"><para id="fs-id1743115"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2024685" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2024686"><para id="fs-id2024687"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2810957">
          <para id="fs-id2810960"> <m:math>
            <m:mtable>
              <m:mtr>
                <m:mtd>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                </m:mtd>
              </m:mtr>
              <m:mtr>
                <m:mtd>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi>
                </m:mtd>
              </m:mtr>
            </m:mtable>

          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2467728" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2467729"><para id="fs-id2467730"> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>cos</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>sin</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:msup>
          <m:mi>y</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1831266" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1831267"><para id="fs-id1831268"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mi>h</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mi>h</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>h</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mi>h</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id2167167">
          <para id="fs-id2167170"> <m:math>
            <m:mtable>
              <m:mtr>
                <m:mtd>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>h</m:mi>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>h</m:mi>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                </m:mtd>
              </m:mtr>
              <m:mtr>
                <m:mtd>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cosh</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>sinh</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>h</m:mi>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                </m:mtd>
              </m:mtr>
              <m:mtr>
                <m:mtd>
                  <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>cosh</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>sinh</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>h</m:mi>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>h</m:mi>
                  </m:mfrac>
                  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>h</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>h</m:mi>
                  </m:mfrac>

                </m:mtd>
              </m:mtr>
            </m:mtable>

          </m:math>
          </para>
        </solution></exercise>


      <para id="fs-id1647857">Untuk latihan berikut, buktikan atau sangkal pernyataan-pernyataan tersebut.</para>
      <exercise id="fs-id1647860"><problem id="fs-id1647861"><para id="fs-id1647862"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>u</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>v</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>u</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>v</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>u</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>v</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2575246"><problem id="fs-id2575247"><para id="fs-id2575248"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>u</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>v</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>u</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>v</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>u</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>v</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
        <solution id="fs-id1369516">
          <para id="fs-id1369518">Benar</para>
        </solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1369522"><problem id="fs-id1369523"><para id="fs-id1369524"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:msup>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:msup>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id1859738" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1859739"><para id="fs-id1859740">Jika <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>, </m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>γ</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> merupakan sudut-sudut dalam segitiga yang sama, buktikan atau sangkal <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>γ</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </para></problem>
      <solution id="fs-id2290241">
        <para id="fs-id2290243">Benar. Perhatikan bahwa <m:math>
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
              <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>γ</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em" />
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan uraikan ruas kanan. </para></solution></exercise>
      <exercise id="fs-id2640056" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id2640057"><para id="fs-id2640058">Jika <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>γ</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:math> merupakan sudut-sudut dalam segitiga yang sama, buktikan atau sangkal <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>γ</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>α</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>β</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>γ</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>

      </para></problem></exercise>
    </section>
  </section>
</content>
</document>